#39700
Atlantis Credits Room~
This is Atlantis an underwater city ruled by Neptune and not friendly to air breathers
levels 15-35 originally created by Vanyel..converted to Circle by Corwin. links
to Reggid Ocean at nnnnnnn
~
397 33 0 0 0 8 255 0
S
#39701
Inside the Main Gate of Atlantis~
Congratulations!  You must have had the proper credentials to get past
the Jellyfish Guards.  Spread out before you is the beautiful City of
Atlantis.  Spirialing towers can be seen in the distance, and you can just
make out a sparkling palace on the horizon.  All around you, Merfolk are
going about their business peacefully.  Strangely enough, they don't seem to
notice you, despite the fact you're obviously a Land-Dweller.  
~
