#39702
Intersection of Pacifica Blvd. and Oceana Ave.~
You have reached the intersection of Pacifica Blvd.  And Oceana Ave. 
Strange, unpleasant odors waft to your nose (which is really hard, since
you're underwater).  Yot notice that the roads aren't very clean, nor are
the people wandering by.  This must be th poor section of Atlantis.  I'd
watch where I were going if I were you ..  Never know what'll float by.  
~
