#39703
Along North Pacifica Blvd.~
North Pacifica isn't the best street in Atlantis.  There is grime and
dirt on all the buildings, and the cobblestones that line the streets are
broken.  There are holes in the road, where the cobblestones have been
stolen for other things ...  Like pillows.  Putrid, oily streaks go along
through the current.  I'd not touch them if I were you.  On either side of
the road, you can see one of the many buildings that make up the slave
quarters of Atlantis.  
~
