#39704
Slave Quarters.~
Every eye in the hut turns on you as you enter the door.  Some of the
slaves are filled with fear, while others possess great anger.  Upon looking
around the room, you notice this looks like a stereotypical slave barrack. 
Sections of the floor have been partioned off to form crude sleeping areas. 
There is no kitchen, but some slaves are eating raw fish.  Out of the corner
of your eye, you notice one of the oily streaks drifting idly from a pit in
the corner of the room.  Hmm.  
~
