#39709
The Slave Master's Quarters.~
You have entered the Slave Master's quarters.  It doesn't like like
anything's been here in a while!  Either that or the Slave Master isn't a
very good housekeeper.  There is filth covering everything.  The table is
broken, and there is no mattress on the bed.  You can faintly see the
outline of a key in the dirt, along with something else...  
~
