#39720
Along North Atlantica Ave.~
Atlantica Avenue is better than Pacifica, but just barely.  There is less
garbage and grime, and the people don't look half-dead.  But the Merfolk
moving about before you aren't well-off.  Hunger and fatigue have taken
their toll on the common citizens of Atlantis.  The houses have little in
the way of luxuries, and the Merfolk along Atlantica Avenue barely have
enough to survive.  
~
