#39721
Home of an Atlantean Peasant~
This is the home of one of the common citizens of Atlantis.  They aren't
much better than Slave Quarters.  There are actual beds, and some makeshift
furniture, but not much else.  The cupboards are practically bare, with
hardly enough for a sea-horse to eat.  There are no decorations,
what-so-ever, aside from some crude drawings made by the children at
Atlantis Elementary School.  
~
