#39726
Atlantis Community School~
This is the Atlantean Community School.  All levels of eduation are
represented here, from the small tadpoles to the almost fully-grown
MerTeenagers.  The teacher, Ms.  Tunaski, is trying to instruct her younger
students on the values of a fully-balances diet, but the older children seem
to be rather disruptive.  
~
