#39734
LandDweller's 'R' Us ~
LandDweller's 'R' Us is the local human-food restaurant.  They serve
burgers and fries and other "human" delicacies.  The owner, Ariel, developed
a taste for human foods while attempting to become on of them.  Since that
time, she has opened this restaurant for others to sample LandDweller
cusine.  
~
