#39736
Intersection of Sea Road and Oceana Ave.~
You have reached the intersection of Sea Road and Oceana Avenue.  To the
north, are the merchant's homes.  They're better off than the peasants, but
they're still not as wealthy as the nobles.  To the south are the homes of
the Atlantean soldiers.  They get special treatment because they are the
protectors of the city.  You'll find the Atlantean Police Station to the far
south.  
~
