#39737
Along North Sea Road~
This is North Sea Road.  The houses along this stretch of land are quite
elaborate, with flashy carvings on the doors and windows.  There are
tapestries hanging (floating?)  In the windows, and there are tables infront
of the houses with some of their wares on them.  
~
