#39738
A Merchant's House~
This home is much more elaborate than any others you have entered so far.
There are actual draperies hanging at the windows, and furniture!  There are
beds, and a table for eating.  And an actual kitchen!  And trinkets!  There
are so many trinkets around the room, your hands begin to itch.  Gold and
silver.  And this is only a Merchant!  
~
