Poseidon's Potion Shop~
This is Poseidon's Potion Shop.  All kinds of potions are sold here, and
you can probably get whatever you want.  There is an old, craggly man
sitting behind the counter.  He barely looks up as you walk in, and mutters
something about people waking him up all the time.  
~
