Along South Sea Road~
This stretch of road is called South Sea Road.  The houses here are very
plain.  You would almost think they were Slave Quarters, except they're in
much better condition.  You notice a sign above every door, a Shield, with
Crossed Swords.  These must be the Police Barracks.  
