#39745
The Police Barracks~
These are the soldier's barracks.  They look like, well, soldier's
barracks.  There are rows of beds, each one made up nicely, and so tight you
could bounce a quarter on them (if you could bounce a quarter underwater). 
Footlockers sit at the ends of each bed, containing their personal items. 
Their boots are polished and lined up along side their footlockers, and
their weapons sit on top of the lockers, gleaming through the water.  
~
