could bounce a quarter on them (if you could bounce a quarter underwater). 
Footlockers sit at the ends of each bed, containing their personal items. 
Their boots are polished and lined up along side their footlockers, and
their weapons sit on top of the lockers, gleaming through the water.  
~
397 33 0 0 0 8 255 0
D3
~
~
0 0 39747
S
#39750
Along South Water Way~
This is South Water Way.  The houses here are huge!  Much bigger than
anything you've seen so far, but still small in comparison to the Palace
that awaits you toward the east.  The homes along Water Way are magnificant,
with carvings and other decorations covering the walls.  There isn't a speck
of dirt to be found.  This really is paradise.  
~
