#39751
Intersection of Water Way and Oceana Ave.~
You've come to the final intersection of Atlantis.  Running north and
south is Water Way.  This is the "ritzy" part of Atlantis, where all the
nobles live.  Take a walk, er swim, and check it out.  Be careful where you
go, however.  Rich people, even Merfolk, can be very paranoid about their
money and their land.  
~
