#39753
The House of a Noble Atlantean Family~
This is the house of one of the Altantean Nobility.  The family crossarms
hangs on the wall, along with numerous pictures and banners - trophies from
wars, no doubt.  As you enter, you are surrounded by members of the
nobility, wanting to know what right you, an obvious LandDweller, have
barging right into their home.  I think you have insulted them.  Good.  
~
