#39758
An Old Abandonded Building~
This old building has been abandoned.  You wonder why.  It looks like it
used to be a warehouse.  Crates are piled in high stacks, and in the corner,
one creative soul actually made a crate-pyramid.  A couple of the stacks
have falled over, but nobody bothered to come pick them up.  They are lying
in pieces strewn across the floor.  One of the pieces seems to have become
lodged in a crack in the floor.  Perhaps you should investigate it?  
~
