#39766
Neptune's Royal Staircase~
This is Neptune's Royal Staircase.  It leads, obviously, to his Palace. 
It's made of solid gold, and it long and high and tiring.  You're suddenly
glad you don't have to make this trip everyday, it would be tiresome!  The
light shining off the gold and reflecting through the water hurts you eyes,
and you wish you had something to shade your eyes.  
~
