#39778
The Royal Seal of Neptune~
Every ruler of Atlantis has had a royal seal.  It is made competely of
gold, with precious jewels imbedded into the metal before setting.  A giant
sea-manta, dwarfing all other life, is shown in the seal.  Twin diamonds
serve as the manta's eyes, and they seem to look right back at you.  
~
