#39786
The Inner Sanctum~
This is the Inner Sanctum.  King Neptune keeps his collection of
concubines here for safe keeping.  Legend has it, there is a great monster
that inhabits the Grand Center Stage, so nobody enters it.  All around you,
lovely MerMaids in silk scarves (and little else) scurry about, hoping to
please their master.  One of them shimmers up to you, a hopeful look in her
eyes.  
~
