The Grand Center Stage~
The Grand Center Stage is a large room.  It looks like it used to be a
meeting room, or maybe the Kings' reception area.  Now, it's just empty. 
And dark, very dark.  Your eyes seem to have a hard time adjusting to the
lights.  Something doesn't feel right...  
