#39795
Neptune's Outer Chambers~
You have breached the outer chambers of Neptune, Lord of Atlantis.  You
are not supposed to be here.  Two MerMen, the largest you've ever seen,
stand guard, and you imagine there are probably plenty more waiting hidden
in the wings.  If you're smart, you'll leave now.  If you're lucky, the
guards will let you.  
~
