#39796
Neptune's Private Chambers~
Somehow you must have defeated Neptune's Guards.  These are Neptune's
Private Chambers, and he doesn't appreciate intruders.  As you stand here,
gawking at the elaborate carvings and priceless treasures, you feel a
presence in the shadows.  Looking closer, you notice it is one of Neptune's
Concubines.  And behind her ..  Neptune!  
~
